        "content": "perations\n\nPurpose: Coordinates AI data extraction, lead scoring, database logging, and multi-channel team notifications.\n\nNodes Included:\n\nMessage a model: Sends raw lead data to Gemini to analyze details and generate insights or lead scores.\n\nInsert Basic Details (use in duplication check): Stores initial lead data to ensure future duplicate detection works.\n\nJSON Parsing code: Formats and structures the output returned by the Gemini AI model.\n\nChecking lead score: Evaluates the AI-generated score against predefined thresholds to route qualified vs. unqualified leads.\n\nLead Information (Google Sheets): Appends enriched lead details into the primary database or spreadsheet.\n\nConfirmation email: Automates direct email responses to new leads.\n\nSlack message to teams: Posts updates to internal Slack channels to alert team members about new or high-value leads.",
